{
  "name": "07 · Referral Asker (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 07 · Referral Asker\nTwo days after delivery it asks the customer for a 1-5 rating. **4-5** → Google review link + a referral ask (\"send a friend's number\"). **1-3** → no review request; the owner gets a private alert and the customer gets a sorry message. Referrals and other replies go straight to the owner.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Orders**: Delivered date (yyyy-mm-dd), Name, Phone, Product.\n2. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup).\n3. Replace YOUR_GOOGLE_REVIEW_LINK (Google Business Profile → Ask for reviews). Replace YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP with the owner's WhatsApp number in 91XXXXXXXXXX format.\n4. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).",
        "height": 616,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "3cb4af8d-94ee-4e37-974d-f397392357a4",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 19,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "f65c1b6d-ad73-4eb9-857d-0107d23d6cae",
      "name": "Daily 7 PM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Orders"
        },
        "options": {},
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "Delivered date",
              "lookupValue": "={{ $now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').minus({ days: 2 }).toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd') }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "db577ffd-0590-4846-9ef0-346508b30983",
      "name": "Delivered 2 days ago",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        -160
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $json.Phone }}",
        "textBody": "=Hello {{ $json.Name }} ji, thank you for choosing YOUR BUSINESS NAME 🙏\nHow was your experience with your {{ $json.Product }}, from 1 to 5? (just reply with the number)",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "bb1429a8-aa36-4cd8-80d1-a9c86add8298",
      "name": "Ask rating",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "messages"
        ]
      },
      "id": "701486b1-d727-4a64-8e73-b77c6c365435",
      "name": "Customer replies",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const t = $json.messages?.[0]?.text?.body || '';\nconst n = Number((t.trim().match(/^[^\\d]{0,12}([1-5])\\b/) || [])[1] || 0);\nreturn { json: { phone: $json.messages?.[0]?.from, name: $json.contacts?.[0]?.profile?.name || '', rating: n, text: t } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "6ea78f90-3f45-4e37-a0bc-b75ab35bdcf7",
      "name": "Read rating",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.rating > 0 }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "65cd5d2f-7563-44bb-b8b2-6bd5dd1e5210",
      "name": "Gave a rating?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.rating >= 4 }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0c1ba0a5-29fd-4429-a2db-6611713975c5",
      "name": "Happy (4-5)?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $json.phone }}",
        "textBody": "=Thank you so much {{ $json.name }} ji! 😊 If you have 30 seconds, a Google review helps us a lot:\nYOUR_GOOGLE_REVIEW_LINK\n\nAnd if a friend or relative needs the same, just send their name and number here. We will take good care of them 🙏",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "79b90921-d515-4449-bf33-a3d9ccca7d86",
      "name": "Review link + referral ask",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=A customer named {{ $json.name || '(name unknown)' }} rated our product/service {{ $json.rating }}/5 two days after delivery and wrote: \"{{ $json.text }}\".\nWrite (1) owner_summary: 1 line on what went wrong, for the owner; (2) reply: a polite apology (max 2 lines) asking what went wrong and saying the owner will call personally. Do not ask for a review.\nRULES (never break these): You are an assistant for YOUR BUSINESS NAME, a small Indian business, not the owner. Never offer or hint at discounts, refunds, free items or compensation. Never promise delivery dates, results or guarantees that are not given in this prompt. Never invent prices, stock, policies or facts: use ONLY the data given in this prompt. Greet with 'Hello <name> ji' (never 'Namaste'). Reply in the customer's language (English, Hindi or Hinglish in Roman script).",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "8e8efa82-123b-47be-b62d-52921a0d698b",
      "name": "AI summarises issue",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        960,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "c5c7314f-b415-4455-9100-fa9a13859fef",
      "name": "AI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        900,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"owner_summary\": \"Rated 2/5: delivery late, box damaged\",\n  \"reply\": \"Hello Faisal ji, sorry to hear this 🙏 ...\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "b17e24d7-e60c-41f3-ad04-9b50264ca9c4",
      "name": "JSON shape",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "=YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP",
        "textBody": "=👎 {{ $json.output.owner_summary }}\nCustomer: {{ $('Read rating').item.json.name }} · {{ $('Read rating').item.json.phone }} (private, please call)",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "5d1af47b-d5ec-4826-926e-594fcd3b683c",
      "name": "Private alert to owner",
